{"slug":"Game-Store-Tycoon-Money-Giver-93314","_id":"6977e68fc25a5dde21f5d6d8","title":"Money Giver","game":{"_id":"6977e68fc25a5dde21f5d6d5","gameId":10963175,"name":"[100M] Game Store Tycoon 🎮 ","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-239eced723709643843eb6f22031184b-2a868e317f88.png","placeId":10963175},"features":"🔧 Script Features – Game Store Tycoon\n\n💰 Gives Up To 10,000 Cash\nGrants money to your tycoon, capped at a maximum of 10K.\n\n🎯 Auto Detects Your Tycoon\nAutomatically finds the tycoon you own in workspace.Tycoons.\n\n🧠 Owner-Only Execution\nOnly works on the tycoon where you are the owner.\n\n🔒 Safe Targeting\nDoes not affect other players’ tycoons.\n\n⚡ Fast & Lightweight\nExecutes instantly with a simple loop, no performance impact.\n\n🛠️ Easy to Configure\nYou can change the amount by editing:\n\nlocal money = 10000\n\n\n🚫 Hard Limit Protection\nScript respects the game’s 10K maximum payout limit.","tags":[],"script":"local money = 10000\nlocal children = workspace.Tycoons:GetChildren()\nfor i, child in ipairs(children) do\n   if child.Info.Owner.Value == game.Players.LocalPlayer.Name then\n       child.Control.Money:FireServer(money)\n   end\nend","owner":{"_id":"695a18c087491d6780dd0d95","username":"SignalDrop","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/695a18c087491d6780dd0d95-1769325605391.png","status":"offline","id":"695a18c087491d6780dd0d95","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":3199,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-8e155065c545cab932075ff968dac85f-43b6e974440d.png","likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-01-26T22:11:27.743Z","keyLink":"","executes":1007,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6977e68fc25a5dde21f5d6db","editBy":{"_id":"695a18c087491d6780dd0d95","username":"SignalDrop","status":"offline","id":"695a18c087491d6780dd0d95"},"message":"Create script","create